Subject: [PATCH 07060/11362] [outer-loop] Tasks 10+11: sp80 regression
 diagnosis + dynamics-gate pass-rate survey

Task 10 (why bare_control beat full_stack on sp80 in exp5701): instrumented
all three "richer stack" mechanisms (candidate_router, goal_bias,
goal_candidate_guidance) during a real sp80 replay. All three confirmed
structurally inert -- goal_bias (arc_goal_energy_live.GoalSatisfactionEnergy,
Exp4020) scored EXACTLY 1.0 on all 771 real frontier-node invocations (zero
variance, mathematically incapable of influencing search order);
goal_candidate_guidance self-detected its own degeneracy and correctly
no-op'd by existing design; candidate_router was invoked 33 times but never
changed the candidate ordering. Honest conclusion: the regression is not
caused by a bad learned signal, it is structurally impossible for these
mechanisms to be the cause -- the real cause is one of the other differing
knobs (value_weight/DAgger value head, navigation_cost_tiebreak,
action_effect_expansion_prior), not further isolated here. Separately
surfaced GoalSatisfactionEnergy's blindness on sp80's placement mechanic,
corroborating ops/verifier_gaps.md GAP-4891's independent finding via a
completely different code path -- logged as GAP-5703 per the
Missing-Verifier Gap Logging discipline with a concrete fix recommendation.

Task 11 (is the min_heldout_accuracy=1.0 dynamics gate over-strict): surveyed
95 real round-level heldout_accuracy values across 12 real live_llm_inference
artifacts. pass_rate_at_live_threshold=0.1263 (only 12.6% of real induction
rounds ever reach 1.0); exact_zero_rate=0.4737. Corroborates task 8's
single-attempt dynamics-gate-dominance finding with corpus-scale evidence.
Honest limitation disclosed: this is per-row, not the bounded 3-round retry
loop's eventual success rate (insufficient multi-round traces in the corpus
to reconstruct that statistic).

Adds experiment_5702_dynamics_gate_pass_rate_survey.py,
experiment_5703_sp80_candidate_stack_mechanism_trace.py, their real result
artifacts (both adversarial_verify clean), 16 tests, REQ-ARC-FCP-5703 +
REQ-ARC-WMTE-5593-4 spec.md sections, GAP-5703 in ops/verifier_gaps.md, and
ops/known-issues.md closure notes. The substantive script/artifact/spec.md
content landed via a concurrent conductor checkpoint commit (5d10f4320,
byte-identical, verified via git diff) before this commit -- this commit adds
the two spec/gap-declaration test assertions still outstanding plus the
known-issues.md write-up.

